# =============================================================================
# ~/.ssh/config — NODE variant (orchestrate from zabeth22 or any node)
#
# Use this instead of the workstation config when you run the scripts from
# *inside* the cluster. Nodes reach each other over the LAN (172.26.145.x) with
# no gateway hop, which also makes sync_models.sh take the fast direct-rsync
# path instead of relaying through the orchestrator.
#
# Install the key on all three nodes first (scripts/bootstrap_ssh.sh pushes to
# every node), then:
#     ssh zabeth23 'hostname'
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2026-09-17 — the IP patterns below are NOT optional.
#
# `sync_models.sh` runs its peer checks and its rsyncs against
# `msalhi@172.26.145.NN`: it resolves the peer with `node_ip`, so it never uses
# the alias. ssh applies `IdentityFile` / `IdentitiesOnly` only to a Host pattern
# that actually MATCHES, so a name-only config silently falls back to the default
# identities, the reachability test fails, and sync_models.sh relays 6.9 GB
# through the orchestrator instead of copying over the LAN — the exact opposite
# of what this file is for. Verified on the live cluster: with names only the
# inner `ssh msalhi@172.26.145.72 true` failed; adding the IP patterns made all
# six node-to-node directions succeed and sync_models.sh print
# `zabeth23 -> zabeth21 : direct rsync (LAN)`.
#
# Authorising the public key on the nodes is also not sufficient on its own: the
# node doing the push needs the PRIVATE key. Use
# `scripts/bootstrap_ssh.sh --yes --node-to-node`, which installs both this
# config and the key on every node (and says what that costs).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Shared block: covers the aliases AND the LAN addresses the scripts use.
Host zabeth21 zabeth22 zabeth23 172.26.145.71 172.26.145.72 172.26.145.73
    User msalhi
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_zabeth
    IdentitiesOnly yes
    StrictHostKeyChecking accept-new
    ServerAliveInterval 30
    ServerAliveCountMax 3

Host zabeth21
    HostName 172.26.145.71

Host zabeth22
    HostName 172.26.145.72

Host zabeth23
    HostName 172.26.145.73
